A618 SGFX IR3 shader-pack provenance
=====================================

This directory's locally authored producer and helper programs are project
source code, licensed GPL-2.0-only:

* sgfx_compile.c
* pack_state.py
* verify_pack.py
* verify_packed_state.py

The producer is compiled against Mesa's IR3 compiler and uses metadata/state
semantics from the Mesa source tree pinned below. No Mesa source file is
copied into this directory. Mesa is obtained from:

  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa.git
  commit 3f1b217baffffa00cb8f53e158713a33e1bd4632

The relevant Mesa files, including the IR3 compiler, A6xx XML descriptors,
and Turnip state emission, are MIT-licensed. Their individual copyright and
license notices remain in the Mesa checkout and are not replaced by this
notice.

The *.bin, *.disasm, mesa-metadata.json, and packed-state.json files are
deterministic generated data produced from the above Mesa revision by the
GPL-2.0-only local producer/helpers. They are distributed as project artifacts
under GPL-2.0-only; this does not change the license of Mesa source.
